# Runtime secrets and call artifacts — NEVER commit these. The self-host
# quickstart (packages/openphonex-gateway/deploy/SELFHOST.md) has you create
# filled-in credential files and per-call directories from the *.example
# templates; only the *.example templates belong in git.

# Filled-in credentials (the *.example versions are tracked; these are not)
**/.env
**/.env.livekit
**/.env.registrar
**/livekit.yaml
**/sip.yaml
**/carrier.env

# Per-call recordings, transcripts, sessions, evidence
**/sessions/
**/call-evidence/

# Python caches / build artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
